c>FOXO1</italic>, Forkhead box O-class 1; 95% CI, 95% confidence interval.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Clinico-pathological features and <italic>FOXO1</italic> immunohistochemical staining scores of primary bladder transitional cell carcinomas</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-24-468-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p><sup>*</sup>Test for a linear trend across the immunohistochemical staining score; <sup>&#x02020;</sup>0 for negative, 1 for moderate regional, 2 for moderate diffuse, 3 for intense regional, 4 for intense diffuse.</p><p><italic>FOXO1</italic>, Forkhead box O-class 1.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>